::PC_U03_L01_Q01::
Question ID: PC_U03_L01_Q01
MLA Standard: MLA.PC.TR.7
Question:
Which statement correctly describes angle measure?
{
=A. 180 degrees equals pi radians.#Correct. 180 degrees is equivalent to pi radians.
~B. 360 degrees equals pi radians.#360 degrees equals 2pi radians.
~C. Coterminal angles never differ by a full rotation.#Coterminal angles differ by full rotations.
~D. Radians and degrees cannot be converted.#Degrees and radians are connected by 180 degrees = pi radians.
}
